0..76 Comment "// A model does not reach a function through a theory variable, nor an inert"
77..138 Comment "// field or a package\'s entries outside an inert declaration."
139..141 Comment "//"
142..220 Comment "// A generic encoder over a module needs the type of a model from the value of"
221..295 Comment "// its theory, and it reads every field of the model. `std.build` computes"
296..372 Comment "// the entries\' type from the value instead, and its maps read inert fields."
373..375 Comment "//"
376..452 Comment "// `Model` reads the name of a theory, so a `Theory` variable names no model"
453..529 Comment "// type. Only the manifest step and an inert declaration read an inert field"
530..604 Comment "// of a model, and the entries of a package\'s model hold its inert fields."
605..607 Comment "//"
608..623 Comment "// - see: #4730"
624..692 Comment "// - see: #6046 — the entries\' type that a theory\'s value computes"
693..771 Comment "// - see: `../../model/desc/module-reflection.gandr` — what reaches a module"
